<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυγν-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hated, abhorred</i>, of persons and things, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				80
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					886
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ στυγνὲ δαῖμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					472
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ στυγνὸς αἰών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1348
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῶβαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					561
				</span></i>
			, etc.: c. dat., <i>hateful</i> or <i>hostile</i> to one,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				286
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				918
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οτέρως, ἔχειν πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1301.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii/i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>gloomy, sullen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					639
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				777
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφρύων νέφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					172
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				290
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυγνοὶ κλαίουσιν Ἔρωτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					3.67
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρᾶν στυγνός</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαιδρός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.6.9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.182
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				57.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.5.9
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					17.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱονεὶ πυρὸς εἰσπεσόντος εἰς
				ὕδωρ στυγνὸν σέλας ἐκπέμπουσα [λιγνύς</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Adam.
				<u>Vent.</u>
				34
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. διαγωγαὶ καὶ ἀναγνώσεις καὶ
				διηγήματα</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρεθιστικὰ
				τῶν ἀφροδισίων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.46
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυγνὸς μὲν εἴκων δῆλος εἶ</span>
			<i>sullenly, with an ill grace</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				673
			</span></i>: neut. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυγνὸν οἰμώξας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1226
				</span></i>
			.</div>
